  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3cf711bd06ef4f479a2906fc1414ca9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vieja12_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.Dialogues.DialoguesData
  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - <wave amplitude=2>I was thinking, <color=#FF00FF>Sonny</color>...</wave>
  - Getting all this way was (cof) tough for me.
  - I visited places I never wanted to return to. Relived memories I thought were
    dead.
  - <color=yellow>I don't even know how I reached this horrible place</color=yellow>,
    in fact. I feel so far from home...
  - I want to come back home.
